{"dir": "in", "tag": "agent_message_chunk", "delay": 110, "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_9f3c21a7", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "读完了。[docs/acp-projection.md](docs/acp-projection.md) 对投影面没有额外约束，规则 3 的样式单一来源在 [lib/theme/tokens.dart](lib/theme/tokens.dart)，所以校验可以纯静态做。\n\n"}, "messageId": "msg_r1"}}}}
{"dir": "in", "tag": "agent_message_chunk", "delay": 110, "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_9f3c21a7", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "## 样式字面量校验\n\n把检查拆成三层，任一层命中即 `exit 1`：\n\n"}, "messageId": "msg_r1"}}}}
{"dir": "in", "tag": "agent_message_chunk", "delay": 110, "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_9f3c21a7", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "1. 扫描面：`lib/**/*.dart`，排除 `lib/theme/` 与 `lib/bridge/`（frb 生成物）。\n2. 禁止模式：`Color(0x…)`、`Colors.`、裸 `EdgeInsets.all(12)` 这类数值字面量。\n3. 白名单：只有 `tokens.dart` 可以出现字面量。\n\n"}, "messageId": "msg_r1"}}}}
{"dir": "in", "tag": "agent_message_chunk", "delay": 110, "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_9f3c21a7", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "### 落地步骤\n\n- [x] 确认 tokens.dart 是唯一样式来源\n- [x] 在 validate.ps1 里加 `Assert-NoStyleLiteral`\n- [ ] 补一条故意违规的用例，验证会失败\n- [ ] 回填任务卡验收项\n\n"}, "messageId": "msg_r1"}}}}
{"dir": "in", "tag": "agent_message_chunk", "delay": 110, "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_9f3c21a7", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "### 一处提醒\n\n> 接线轮里 `tokens.dart` 与画板 widget 文件应零 diff；这条校验只拦新增字面量，不会替你审已有的偏差。\n\n---\n\n"}, "messageId": "msg_r1"}}}}
{"dir": "in", "tag": "agent_message_chunk", "delay": 110, "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_9f3c21a7", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "函数名用 `Assert-*` 前缀，和脚本里既有的 `Assert-PinnedUpstream` 对齐；~~`Check-*`~~ 不用。"}, "messageId": "msg_r1"}}}}
{"dir": "in", "tag": "agent_message_chunk", "delay": 200, "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_9f3c21a7", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "```powershell\n# scripts/validate.ps1 —— CLAUDE.md 规则 3：widget 文件禁止样式字面量\nfunction Assert-NoStyleLiteral {\n  param([string]$Root = \"lib\")\n  $pattern = 'Color\\\\(0x|Colors\\\\.|EdgeInsets\\\\.(all|symmetric|only)\\\\(\\\\s*\\\\d'\n  $skip    = '^lib/(theme|bridge)/'\n\n  $hits = Get-ChildItem -Path $Root -Recurse -Filter '*.dart' |\n    Where-Object { $_.FullName -notmatch $skip } |\n    Select-String -Pattern $pattern\n\n  if ($hits) {\n    throw \"发现 $($hits.Count) 处样式字面量，样式唯一来源是 lib/theme/tokens.dart\"\n  }\n  Write-Host '  [ok] 无样式字面量' -ForegroundColor Green\n}\n```"}, "messageId": "msg_r2"}}}}
{"dir": "in", "tag": "agent_message_chunk", "delay": 160, "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_9f3c21a7", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "```powershell\nGet-ChildItem -Path lib -Recurse -Filter '*.dart' | Where-Object { $_.FullName -notmatch $skip } | Select-String -Pattern $pattern | ForEach-Object { Write-Host \"  规则 3 违规: $($_.Path):$($_.LineNumber)\" }\n```"}, "messageId": "msg_r3"}}}}
{"dir": "in", "tag": "agent_message_chunk", "delay": 200, "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_9f3c21a7", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "| 检查项 | 扫描面 | 违规即 | 耗时 |\n|:---|:---|:---:|---:|\n| 样式字面量 | `lib/**/*.dart` | exit 1 | 0.8s |\n| 钉版本一致 | `pins/upstream.json` | exit 1 | 0.2s |\n| gpui 不进主进程 | `rust/**/Cargo.toml` | exit 1 | 0.3s |\n| _meta 键白名单 | `lib/projection/` | warn | 0.4s |"}, "messageId": "msg_r4"}}}}
{"dir": "in", "tag": "agent_message_chunk", "delay": 220, "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_9f3c21a7", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    User([用户操作 / 界面输入]) --> Client[AcpAgentClient（Flutter 前端）]\n    Client -->|FRB 桥接| Core[Rust 核心 acp-core（cdylib）]\n    Core -->|ACP 线上 JSON-RPC| Agent[Zed Sidecar / 各主流 Agent]\n    Agent -->|session/update| Core\n    Core -->|acp/session_update| Client\n    Client --> Proj[严格 ACP 投影状态层]\n    Proj --> UI[画板 Widget 虚拟渲染]\n```"}, "messageId": "msg_r5"}}}}
{"dir": "in", "tag": "agent_message_chunk", "delay": 200, "msg": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_9f3c21a7", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "全量扫描的代价是线性的：单文件均摊 $O(n)$，其中 $n$ 是字节数；四项检查串起来的总时长\n\n$$\\sum_{i=1}^{4} t_i = 1.7\\,\\mathrm{s} \\le T_{\\mathrm{budget}} = 5\\,\\mathrm{s}$$\n\n仍在 pre-commit 的预算内，所以不做增量缓存。"}, "messageId": "msg_r6"}}}}
